{"page":402,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:46","surah":29,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَا تُجَـٰدِلُوٓا۟ أَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ إِلَّا بِٱلَّتِى هِىَ أَحْسَنُ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ ۖ وَقُولُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا بِٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْنَا وَأُنزِلَ إِلَيْكُمْ وَإِلَـٰهُنَا وَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ وَٰحِدٌ وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Believers], argue only in the best way with the People of the Book, except with those of them who act unjustly. Say, ‘We believe in what was revealed to us and in what was revealed to you; our God and your God are one [and the same]; we are devoted to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُجَـٰدِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"argue","transliteration":"tujādilū","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلَ","en_gloss":"(with the) People of the Book","transliteration":"ahla","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(with the) People of the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"by which","transliteration":"bi-allatī","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"[it]","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَحْسَنُ","en_gloss":"(is) best","transliteration":"aḥsanu","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"(do) wrong","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَقُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"waqūlū","verse_key":"29:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"We believe","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":