If you had done so, those who follow falsehood might have had cause to doubt.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"(did) you","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَتْلُوا۟","en_gloss":"recite","transliteration":"tatlū","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","en_gloss":"Book","transliteration":"kitābin","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَخُطُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"(did) you write it","transliteration":"takhuṭṭuhu","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِيَمِينِكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"with your right hand","transliteration":"biyamīnika","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذًۭا","en_gloss":"in that case","transliteration":"idhan","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّٱرْتَابَ","en_gloss":"surely (would) have doubted","transliteration":"la-ir'tāba","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","en_gloss":"the falsifiers","transliteration":"l-mub'ṭilūna","verse_key":"29:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٨","en_gloss":"(48)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:48"}]},{"verse_key":"29:49","surah":29,"ayah":49,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ هُوَ ءَايَـٰتٌۢ بَيِّنَـٰتٌ فِى صُدُورِ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْعِلْمَ ۚ وَمَا يَجْحَدُ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ إِلَّا ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But no, [this Quran] is a revelation that is clear to the hearts of those endowed with knowledge. No one refuses to acknowledge Our revelations but the evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"29:49"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key"